OL,4,BCamara to continue with Haas for final 
OL,5,Btwo races                              
OL,6,GBrazilian Rafael Camara will continue  
OL,7,Gto race for the Haas team for the      
OL,8,Gfinal two grands prix of the Formula 1 
OL,9,Gseason.                                
OL,11,FThe 21-year-old, who was already       
OL,12,Fsigned to drive for the US-based team  
OL,13,Fin 2027, was drafted in for this       
OL,14,Fmonth's Sao Paulo Grand Prix after     
OL,15,FFrenchman Esteban Ocon was dropped     
OL,16,Ffollowing a bust-up with team boss     
OL,17,FAyao Komatsu.                          
OL,19,FThe decision to keep Camara in the     
OL,20,FHaas seat in preparation for next      
OL,21,Fseason means he will likely lose the   
OL,22,FFormula 2 title.                       
